1:["$","$Lb",null,{"children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"page-intro","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"eyebrow","children":"Источники / методология"}],["$","h1",null,{"children":"На чём стоят объяснения."}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Первичные материалы для проверки формул, интерпретаций и условий применения."}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"reference-list","children":[["$","article","https://pubsonline.informs.org/doi/full/10.1287/mnsc.2020.01157",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"https://pubsonline.informs.org/doi/full/10.1287/mnsc.2020.01157","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer","children":["Holtz et al. — Reducing Interference Bias in Online Marketplace Experiments"," ↗"]}]}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Метаэксперимент Airbnb: назначение вариантов отдельным объявлениям и группам. Опубликованная версия оценивает устранённую долю смещения примерно в 20%."}],["$","p",null,{"className":"source-detail","children":"Глава 1 · онлайн-публикация 2024, Management Science 2025 · раздел 5.2"}]]}],["$","article","https://doi.org/10.3982/ECTA12423",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"https://doi.org/10.3982/ECTA12423","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer","children":["Blake, Nosko, Tadelis — Consumer Heterogeneity and Paid Search Effectiveness"," ↗"]}]}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Полевые эксперименты eBay с поисковой рекламой. Оценка краткосрочного ROI −63%, 95%-й интервал [−124%; −3%]; расчёт использует экспериментальный эффект и открытые финансовые данные."}],["$","p",null,{"className":"source-detail","children":"Глава 2 · Econometrica, 2015 · с. 160, 170–171, таблица I"}]]}],["$","article","https://prefrontal.org/files/posters/Bennett-Salmon-2009.pdf",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"https://prefrontal.org/files/posters/Bennett-Salmon-2009.pdf","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer","children":["Bennett et al. — Neural Correlates of Interspecies Perspective Taking in the Post-Mortem Atlantic Salmon"," ↗"]}]}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Оригинальный постер: 16 значимых вокселей из 8 064 до поправок на множество сравнений; после применённых авторами поправок значимых вокселей не осталось."}],["$","p",null,{"className":"source-detail","children":"Глава 3 · постер Human Brain Mapping, 2009 · Methods, GLM Results"}]]}],["$","article","https://research.google/blog/speed-matters/",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"https://research.google/blog/speed-matters/","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer","children":["Jake Brutlag — Speed Matters"," ↗"]}]}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Эксперименты Google с дополнительной задержкой поиска на 100–400 мс: число запросов на пользователя снижалось на 0,2–0,6% в среднем за изученные 4–6 недель."}],["$","p",null,{"className":"source-detail","children":"Глава 4 · Google Research, 2009"}]]}],["$","article","https://www.microsoft.com/en-us/research/publication/a-dirty-dozen-twelve-common-metric-interpretation-pitfalls-in-online-controlled-experiments/",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"https://www.microsoft.com/en-us/research/publication/a-dirty-dozen-twelve-common-metric-interpretation-pitfalls-in-online-controlled-experiments/","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer","children":["Dmitriev et al. — A Dirty Dozen: Twelve Common Metric Interpretation Pitfalls"," ↗"]}]}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Пример MSN: открытие ссылки в новой вкладке изменило состав загрузок. Среднее время загрузки выросло на 8,32%, а число загрузок снизилось на 7,8%."}],["$","p",null,{"className":"source-detail","children":"Глава 5 · KDD, 2017 · § 5.1"}]]}],["$","article","https://careersatdoordash.com/blog/switchback-tests-and-randomized-experimentation-under-network-effects-at-doordash/",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"$Le"}],"$Lf","$L10"]}],"$L11","$L12","$L13","$L14","$L15","$L16","$L17","$L18","$L19","$L1a","$L1b","$L1c","$L1d","$L1e","$L1f"]}],"$L20"]}]
